{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-14_end",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-14",
  "title": "拒絕哀悼",
  "storyCode": "15-15",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-14_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1a5ee06b3946f525c02ff8a3ab4822232373ff32d102c7409e0e02008f957c0b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目標已經消滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stormeye，四點鐘方向，兩擊連射。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對著牆體支柱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stormeye雖然很疑惑，但依舊毫不猶豫地連續射出了兩箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地形在我出手的瞬間發生了變化，障礙物剛好消失，命中敵方……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾，你怎麼做到的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，不是我，是ZOOT算出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，六點鐘方向，直接跳下去。別害怕空洞下面的源石晶簇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他直直飛躍而下，地形再次變化。他開始了永無止境的下墜，直到咒言編織的繩索拉住了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾算得很準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已在此等候多時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聆聽指引，閉目前行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可視範圍內所有敵對目標，成功摧毀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隔離區防線已建立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹得漂亮，小貓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，就是沒有留幾個給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾，接下來怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒數三十秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一波敵人會在你們正前方出現，全力清除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡會開啟通往博士必經之路的新通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！那可以讓罪魁禍首再狠狠心疼一波了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小貓，這次讓我先動手如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒用！可露希爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "周圍的建築結構開始收縮了，它們試圖擠壓我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放出去的無人機也無法找到任何可行的路徑，加固設備也撐不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在算了！在算了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ZOOT正在同時處理很龐大的資訊，給她一點時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "6，5，4，3，2……1！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mechanist，抬頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰影中的天花板開始扭曲，一道泛著寒光的刀鋒劃出了一條通往未知的道路。\n隨後一隻手從中伸了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人說你需要幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時間緊迫，只好用些非常手段了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓緊了，Mechanist！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都在等你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_abyss_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（積蓄能量）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（釋放炙熱的光束）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "激射而出的光束在把源石結晶體圍攏成的包圍圈撕裂開一個巨大的裂縫後，繼續向著遠處掃射過去……擊倒了越來越多的源石結晶體——\n但突然，它被某種力量擋住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "力道不錯嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但小心別傷到博士，Mon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_391_rosmon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你帶領著眾人從黑暗中走了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希就在這裡。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（歡快地抖擻身體）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "支援Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "淨空石棺周圍的敵人。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨時策應我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咒言隨行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那……就是石棺？就一直被隱藏在本艦內？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我初次醒來的地方……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ZOOT識別到凱爾希的訊號在減弱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_167",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必須儘快確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Touch",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希在裡面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Touch",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照Raidian的說法來看，她的狀態可不怎麼樂觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我們需要儘快讓她離開那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Raidian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1730_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再拖延下去，我擔心……她的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能妄動，我們並不清楚凱爾希與石棺的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根據當初的作戰紀錄，在切爾諾伯格時也有人接觸了石棺，最後卻產生了我們都沒預料到的變故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希不一樣。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "交給我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "掩護我。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你毫不遲疑地向石棺走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你觸碰到了冰冷的石棺，它……在回應你。\n不，是凱爾希在回應你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "接下來我們還要一起繼續向前啊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生，你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虛弱的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你們來得很及時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虛弱的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島……怎麼樣了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你向石棺中的人伸出了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "大家都還平安。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "多虧你的努力。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "歡迎回來，凱爾希。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她拉住了你的手，你能感覺到她前所未有地脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你看起來不是很好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "剛剛發生了什麼事？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必在意我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "藉助石棺介入PRTS很困難，但意料之外的是，我收到了一份禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於PRTS和普瑞賽斯的更多情報，我會馬上共享給你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（緊張的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用害怕，Mon3tr。我還站在你面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會拋下你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我已經找到了通往Abyss的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場混亂該結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡受到的干擾很強，我們已經極為靠近Abyss。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這裡沒有路了，Abyss徹底把自己隱藏起來了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這個距離內，我可以清楚地判斷出它的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱爾希站在最深處的牆壁之前，深深地吸了一口氣。\n她從未走到如此深入的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（焦慮的低鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別擔心，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我會陪著她。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你走到了凱爾希的身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也在，凱爾希醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島會共同面對威脅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這次的結果，也許的確會不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我透過石棺保留了部分權限，我來打開一條通路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱爾希觸碰到了那堵隔絕了你們與Abyss的牆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesengineeringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“零號油罐”……謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本艦也終於停下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_abyss_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mon3tr，保護博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來你所有的行動都可以視博士的狀況自行判斷。從未知敵人的威脅中保護博士……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也需要你在博士自身出現任何異樣時，限制博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（信任的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭，隨時注意Dr.{@nickname}的狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一旦我們進入Abyss，我們對於現實的一切認知都有可能受到衝擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "危險隨時會發生，但你和博士的安危永遠是最高優先順序。那個最終的威脅，只有你們才能應對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……我會小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有其他需要我注意的事情嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信你的本心即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，我並未預想到這種局面到來得如此迅速。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在內化宇宙和特里蒙的經歷讓我重新思考了許多，你已經讓我看到了另一種可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來發生的任何事情，對你、對我，對羅德島的所有人而言，都是未知數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，Dr.{@nickname}，我需要你告訴我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是否還對可能面對的危險有任何的遲疑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "沒有。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但並非擔憂面前的危險。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希，你依舊試圖隱藏自己的緊張和猶豫。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不必獨自承受所有的壓力。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（贊同地戳戳凱爾希）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這一次，我和羅德島都站在你的身邊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有你們在，我並不擔心面前的危險。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我反倒擔心你。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你在進入這片區域後極其緊張。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不安的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "請相信，我和羅德島與你同在。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "告訴我接下來需要做什麼。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經喚醒了開啟Abyss的程式，開啟艙室所需的能源已經準備就緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我並沒有進入Abyss的完整權限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "avg_017_huang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那需要我們砸進去嗎？或許Misery也能想出一些辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Abyss堪稱整個泰拉隱蔽程度和安全等級最高的區域之一，目前只有一個人有權限打開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你感受到了凱爾希的眼光聚焦在了你的身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……如果需要我的話。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我不會退縮。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十七年前，當“羅德島”號終於被我找到的時候，其大部分結構都在漫長的歲月裡被侵蝕破壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯有處於核心位置的Abyss和其周邊的區域保存依舊完好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依託於Abyss中的未知能源，PRTS也依舊在正常運轉，並成為了後來我們所依仗的指揮系統的底層框架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但Abyss，從未再有人開啟過，至今已經有……萬餘年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_i11_1R"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直到三年前，當“阿喃那”徹底降臨的時候，我開始意識到危機降臨的速度已經超出了我的預計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一場混亂，我們中的許多人都曾親歷。遺憾與悲痛令我們至今記憶猶新。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸沉默地舉起了袖刃，隨時戒備著任何可能突發的危機。\nRaidian感知到了阿斯卡綸的微妙異常，習慣性利用源石技藝安撫了阿斯卡綸，還有在場的每一位同僚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三年來，我們不斷加強本艦的防禦，數次演練如何應對試圖從內部瓦解羅德島的威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是各位幹員的齊心協力，才讓我們能夠在意外突發時迅速鎖定危機的源頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_i11_1L"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而，我們已經來到濃霧的邊緣，更進一步便是一片未知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也猶豫過。但博士說得對，我們可以解決這次危機，就像過往的每一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我們一直同在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos的骨筆在空中輕揮，言辭自他口中而出，庇佑隨後便到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mechanist",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_521_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們很久沒有如此整齊地共同行動了，感受如何，Logos？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "專注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_i11_1M"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照此前的情報來推斷，Abyss中不只存放著PRTS的核心元件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其中的石棺中極有可能休眠著一位名為“普瑞賽斯”的個體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果普瑞賽斯醒來，我需要你們集全力以最快速度抹除她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這會是我們避免意外的最好辦法，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛甦醒之時會是她最虛弱的時刻……適應現如今的環境也需要一些時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你觸碰到了面前的牆，奇異的觸感讓你心跳加速。\n你有一種直覺。這個地方在等待著你，或者說……這裡本就是為你而存在。\n牆在顫抖。你似乎還聽到了警報聲，它幾乎要刺破你的耳膜。\n你產生了剎那的恍惚，那刺耳的聲音來自現在，還是來自過去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Abyss正在發生變化！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "牆面開始出現不規則的移動，一條裂縫開始產生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "60_i11_2M"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "氣流自裂縫中湧動而出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“面紗”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女妖的咒言化作無形的屏障，擋住了洶湧的氣流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退後，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人戒備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（高昂的嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "粉紅色的絲線自她的法杖上盤旋而起，黑色的王冠浮現於她的頭頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mantra的聲音也在你的心中響起——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不，我有一種預感……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡沒有任何威脅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我先進入，跟緊我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
